OL,3,AMan admits posing as medical student at
OL,4,Ahospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted pretending to be a
OL,7,Fmedical student for several weeks and
OL,8,Faccessing Aberdeen hospital wards and
OL,9,Ffiles.
OL,11,FStephen Simpson, 22, wore medical
OL,12,Fscrubs and NHS branded clothing at
OL,13,FAberdeen Royal Infirmary (ARI), as well
OL,14,Fas having a stethoscope.
OL,16,FAt Aberdeen Sheriff Court, Simpson
OL,17,Fadmitted fraud, between 9 December 2023
OL,18,Fand 26 January 2024. Sentence was
OL,19,Fdeferred until later this month for
OL,20,Freports.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
